いる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2335","sourceWorkId":"21905","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園 3年生。 前作では元彼氏と別れ、加藤祐貴と付き合うことになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口は悪いが彼氏を心から愛している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"超絶テクニシャンな彼氏とセックス三昧な学園生活を送っているため、全身が異常なほど敏感。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日々淫乱になっていくのを自覚しているが、愛する彼氏のためなら……と思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、弾痕丸＆千歳ペアにスワッピングを持ち掛けられ、心中で葛藤が起きている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58252"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/506f392d880c61aa2286748fef51fb37dc27b720067f480b1f4ccd7a2c436b55.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/97ba8a9eb99ff64abf4191011589acc04a2ed52bba509a15c1222c0f585b6055.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柚原みう","creatorId":"vndb:s977","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s977","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s977","name":"柚原 みう","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:139738:58252:15162:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34556","characterName":"柏木 翼","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"58243","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"139738"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7306"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34556"},"originalCharacterName":"柏木 翼","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third-year student at the academy. The protagonist, Dankonmaru's, older sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An excellent student, incredibly athletic, with superb communication skills and a fantastic figure—a perfect girl."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a boyfriend who is nationally famous at his sports."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"They are a popular and beautiful couple at school, admired by all the students."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Gyutto"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34556"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園3年生。主人公・弾痕丸の実姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀、運動神経抜群、コミュ力最強、スタイル抜群の完璧女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツで全国的に有名な彼氏がいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美男美女カップルと学内でも評判で、全学生の憧れの的。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7306","sourceWorkId":"21905","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園 3年生。 主人公・弾痕丸の実姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀、運動神経抜群、コミュ力最強、スタイル抜群の完璧女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツで全国的に有名な彼氏がいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美男美女カップルと学内でも評判で、全学生の憧れの的。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58243"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d3443dd4d12f1ef14e17a31262e5d655eb43ea32d2798e09f09eb3c3959daa4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/44bbad14102ad297c0222340c3d9f48c95eee1c73524b9f13f204d1308c57b11.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花澤さくら","creatorId":"vndb:s947","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s947","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s947","name":"花澤 さくら","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:139738:58243:17075:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34557","characterName":"平泉 千歳","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"58244","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"139738"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7307"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34557"},"originalCharacterName":"平泉 千歳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second-year student at the academy. She's Dankonmaru's childhood friend and classmate."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"They used to play together often as children, but as they grew older,"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"she started criticizing the protagonist's shortcomings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a kind and considerate friend, but she's shy and often says mean things to hide her embarrassment, which leads to misunderstandings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's also critical of Dankonmaru, constantly nagging him about his appearance and telling him to study."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Gyutto"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34557"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園2年生。弾痕丸の幼なじみでクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供の頃はよく一緒に遊んだが、成長するにつれ主人公のダメっぷりにダメ出しをするようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"友達思いの良い子だが照れ屋で、つい照れ隠しの悪態をついてしまうので勘違いされがち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弾痕丸に対しても身だしなみが悪いだの勉強しろだのと口うるさい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7307","sourceWorkId":"21905","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園 2年生。 弾痕丸の幼なじみでクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供の頃はよく一緒に遊んだが、成長するにつれ主人公のダメっぷりにダメ出しをするようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"友達思いの良い子だが照れ屋で、つい照れ隠しの悪態をついてしまうので勘違いされがち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弾痕丸に対しても身だしなみが悪いだの勉強しろだのと口うるさい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58244"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7e43cf4194d21d198b75247b8afef6a068001e5e334da15d6a4e5712a31f814.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a2f367cc16e70b4a30a2b1968e2345ab05cabf7aa9491fdc41e6536e78e5ebab.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水野七海","creatorId":"vndb:s2524","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2524","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2524","name":"星野七海","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:139738:58244:17078:1","source":"bangu